<title>POLAND: GORAZDZE MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>GORAZDZE MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 2.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.40 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.40 vs   1.09</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.56 vs   0.59 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   20.30 vs  11.88</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 2.84 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   2.84 vs   0.92</p>
<p> Operating loss	 5.43 vs   6.09</p>
<p> Sales		   37.12 vs  26.44</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cement maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Cementowo- Wapiennicze Gorazdze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
